<translate>
==== CritDmgMultiplier ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for weapons. Indicates a modifier to a critical hit that is used in calculating the damage of a critical hit.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
CritDmgMultiplier = 1.7,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

